#: ../../../ros2_sim_interfaces.md:3
msgid ""
"The [ROS 2 Simulation Interfaces](https://github.com/ros-simulation/"
"simulation_interfaces) define a standard set of ROS 2 service, message and "
"action definitions for controlling and interacting with simulation "
"environments. These interfaces are simulator-agnostic and aim to provide a "
"unified way to control and observe simulation using ROS 2."
